<title>FINLAND: FINNISH STTK REPEATS CALL FOR 2-YR WAGE, TAX DEAL.</title>
<headline>FINNISH STTK REPEATS CALL FOR 2-YR WAGE, TAX DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Confederation of Finnish Salaried Employees STTK on Monday repeated that it would seek a two-year incomes deal combining pay rises and tax cuts.</p>
<p>&quot;By combining a tax and wage deal, wage-earners' purchasing power will be secured,&quot; the STTK said, listing its demands for a pay deal to begin at the start of February 1998.</p>
</text>
